{"id":18507,"mal_id":18507,"title":"Free!","englishTitle":"Free! - Iwatobi Swim Club","title_english":"Free! - Iwatobi Swim Club","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["フリー！"],"en":"Free! - Iwatobi Swim Club","ja":"Free!"},"synopsis":"Haruka Nanase has a love for water and a passion for swimming. In elementary school, he competed in and won a relay race with his three friends Rin Matsuoka, Nagisa Hazuki, and Makoto Tachibana. After claiming victory at the tournament, the four friends went their separate ways. Years later, they reunite as high school students; however, Rin couldn't care less about returning to the way things used to be. Not only does he attend a different school, but the sole thing important to him is proving that he is a better swimmer than Haruka.\n\nAfter the bitter reunion, Haruka, Nagisa, and Makoto decide to form the Iwatobi High School Swim Club, but they will need a fourth member if they hope to take part in the upcoming tournament. Enter Rei Ryuugazaki, a former member of the track team whom Nagisa recruits. As the time to compete draws near, the four develop a close bond while training intensely to come out on top and settle things between Haruka and Rin once and for all.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Haruka Nanase ama el agua y le apasiona la natación. En la escuela primaria, compitió y ganó una carrera de relevos con sus tres amigos Rin Matsuoka, Nagisa Hazuki y Makoto Tachibana. Después de conseguir la victoria en el torneo, los cuatro amigos tomaron caminos separados. Años más tarde, se reencuentran como estudiantes de secundaria; sin embargo, a Rin no podría importarle menos volver a ser como solían ser las cosas. No solo asiste a una escuela diferente, sino que lo único importante para él es demostrar que es mejor nadador que Haruka.\n\nDespués de la amarga reunión, Haruka, Nagisa y Makoto deciden formar el club de natación de la escuela secundaria Iwatobi, pero necesitarán un cuarto miembro si esperan participar en el próximo torneo. Ingresa Rei Ryuugazaki, un ex miembro del equipo de atletismo a quien Nagisa recluta. A medida que se acerca el momento de competir, los cuatro desarrollan un vínculo estrecho mientras entrenan intensamente para llegar a la cima y arreglar las cosas entre Haruka y Rin de una vez por todas.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1415,"average_episode_duration":1415,"startDate":"2013-07-04","start_date":"2013-07-04","endDate":"2013-09-26","end_date":"2013-09-26","season":"summer","year":2013,"start_season":{"year":2013,"season":"summer"},"episodes":12,"num_episodes":12,"score":7.32,"mean":7.32,"numListUsers":854589,"num_list_users":854589,"genres":[{"id":23,"name":"School"},{"id":30,"name":"Sports"}],"studios":[{"id":2,"name":"Kyoto Animation"},{"id":929,"name":"Animation Do"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":null,"logo_url":null,"tmdb_id":null,"tmdb_updated_at":null,"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/6/51107.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/6/51107l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/6/51107.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/6/51107l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/6/51107l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"thursday","time":"00:30","day_of_the_week":"thursday","start_time":"00:30","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"thursday 00:30"},"rank":3079,"popularity":264,"rating":"pg_13","simkl_id":null,"episodes_data":[],"specials_data":[],"characters":[],"num_scoring_users":465987,"nsfw":"white","created_at":"2013-04-26T13:14:33+00:00","updated_at":"2024-12-17T15:42:39+00:00","source":"original","background":null,"related_anime":[{"node":{"id":17819,"title":"Kyoto Animation: Suiei-hen","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/4/51881.jpg","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/ani